["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">孝</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>孝顺；孝道</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ・キョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">孝行</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">孝顺；孝敬；孝道；尽心侍奉；倾心服务</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">刺</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>刺入；刺激；尖刺；名片</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さ.す・さ.さる・さ.し・さし・とげ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">刺激</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しげき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">刺激；刺痛；刺激感；刺激；动力；促进；鼓励；激励；诱因；兴奋；刺激；快感</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">刺身</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さしみ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">刺身（生鱼片、贝类或甲壳类的生切薄片）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">刺す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">刺；戳；扎；插；刺入；蜇；咬；缝；绣；刺绣；撑（船）；用粘竿捕（鸟兽等）；刺杀（跑垒员）；触杀</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">純</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>纯真；纯粹；纯正；纯净；净（利润）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジュン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">単純</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たんじゅん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">简单；朴素；不复杂；直率；头脑简单；天真</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">純情</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じゅんじょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">纯情；天真；纯真无邪</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">純粋</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じゅんすい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">纯粹；真正；真实；纯正</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">翌</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>下一个；次（日、年等）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヨク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">快</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>愉快；舒适；爽快；畅快</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">こころよ.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">快適</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいてき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">舒适；愉快；宜人</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">愉快</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">愉快；令人高兴的；令人愉悦的；欢乐的；开心的；有趣的；高兴的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">快晴</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいせい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">晴朗；万里无云；好天气</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">片</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>单侧；片面；碎片；片段；薄片</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヘン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かた-・かた</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">片付ける</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かたづける</span><span class=\"k-wz\">整理；收拾；清理；放好；解决；处理；处置；完成；做好；办完；给（女儿）找到婆家；嫁出（女儿）；杀死；除掉；消灭</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">片道</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かたみち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">单程；单向；单程票</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">破片</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はへん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">碎片；破片；碎屑；残片</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">敬</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>尊敬；敬畏；崇敬</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケイ・キョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">うやま.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">敬意</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けいい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">尊敬；敬意</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">尊敬</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そんけい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">尊敬；尊重；敬重</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">敬う</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うやまう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">尊敬；敬重；崇敬；敬仰；敬拜</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">悩</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>烦恼；痛苦；忧虑；苦恼；折磨</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ノウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">なや.む・なや.ます・なや.ましい・なやみ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">悩む</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">