\" lang=\"ja\">漁</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>渔业；捕鱼</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ギョ・リョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あさ.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">漁業</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぎょぎょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">渔业；捕鱼业</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">漁師</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">りょうし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">渔夫；渔民</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">漁船</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぎょせん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">渔船</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">荒</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>荒废；粗暴；荒凉；狂暴；粗糙</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">あ.らす・あ.れる・あら.い・すさ.ぶ・すさ.む・あ.らし</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">荒い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あらい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">粗糙；狂野；粗暴；粗鲁；粗犷；严厉；凶猛；急促（如呼吸）；过度；奢侈；鲁莽</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">荒廃</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうはい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">荒废；毁坏；破坏；废墟；衰败</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">荒らす</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あらす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">荒废；摧毁；破坏；侵入；闯入；刷屏；灌水；骚扰（如网络论坛）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">貯</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>储蓄；储存；积攒；存放；蓄须</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チョ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">た.める・たくわ.える</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">貯金</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちょきん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">存钱；储蓄；存款；（棒球）胜场多于负场的场数差；胜负差盈余</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">貯蔵</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちょぞう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">贮存；保存；储备；囤积；囤积（不用于生产的商品或金钱）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">貯蓄</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちょちく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">储蓄；储钱</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">硬</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>硬；僵硬</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かた.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">硬い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かたい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">硬；坚硬；结实；僵硬；生硬；不流畅；不自然（如文章）；强；稳固；不易动摇；安全；稳妥；诚实；可靠；固执；顽固；书面化；正式；古板；拘谨</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">硬貨</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">硬币；钱币；硬通货</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">強硬</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょうこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">坚定；强硬；不屈不挠；坚定不移；毫不妥协；固执；强硬的</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">埋</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>埋藏；填满；埋没；埋入</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">マイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">う.める・う.まる・う.もれる・うず.める・うず.まる・い.ける</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li